WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.008 --> 00:00:06.832
The T.

2
00:00:14.078 --> 00:00:16.360
rex stomped toward Metro City Elementary School.

3
00:00:20.123 --> 00:00:22.725
Roar! The entire school shook.

4
00:00:23.866 --> 00:00:24.166
The T.

5
00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:25.447
rex peered into a window.

6
00:00:30.011 --> 00:00:32.332
Terrell gulped.

7
00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:34.733
"I thought it would be cool to see real live dinosaurs.

8
00:00:36.034 --> 00:00:37.515
I don't think so anymore!"

9
00:00:37.535 --> 00:00:39.836
"Look at those teeth!"

10
00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:40.737
Jack cried.

11
00:00:40.757 --> 00:00:43.799
"I hope Rocket Girl comes soon!"

12
00:00:44.059 --> 00:00:44.659
said Mara.

13
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.362
Suddenly—zoom! Roxy flew past the T.

14
00:00:49.422 --> 00:00:50.002
rex's head.

15
00:00:50.022 --> 00:00:52.203
"Rocket Girl!"

16
00:00:52.484 --> 00:00:53.184
cried Terrell.

17
00:00:54.144 --> 00:00:55.765
Roxy landed in the kickball field.

18
00:00:55.785 --> 00:00:57.306
"Hey, T.

19
00:00:57.386 --> 00:00:59.207
rex! Try to get me!"

20
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:04.640
The T.

21
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.641
rex roared and stomped toward Roxy.

22
00:01:10.542 --> 00:01:15.023
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted a big hole in the ground.

23
00:01:16.464 --> 00:01:16.804
The T.

24
00:01:16.904 --> 00:01:18.004
rex tumbled into it.

25
00:01:18.805 --> 00:01:25.026
Roar! The dinosaur stomped around in the hole, trapped.

26
00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:29.588
Roxy was about to fly away when she noticed a jeep nearby.

27
00:01:31.296 --> 00:01:34.199
The man inside had a pair of binoculars and a safari hat.

28
00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.142
He was watching two tall dinosaurs eat leaves.

29
00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:40.844
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

30
00:01:40.864 --> 00:01:43.567
"I wonder who that man is."

31
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:47.010
Just then the man looked at Roxy and gasped.

32
00:01:48.131 --> 00:01:50.272
He dropped the binoculars and drove off fast.

33
00:01:50.292 --> 00:01:53.815
"Now that is suspicious!"

34
00:01:54.176 --> 00:01:54.836
said Roxy.

35
00:01:55.817 --> 00:01:58.139
She blasted into the air and flew after the jeep.

36
00:02:01.428 --> 00:02:03.149
Roxy followed the jeep into the mountains.

37
00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:07.010
It soon arrived at a large mansion.

38
00:02:08.491 --> 00:02:10.572
The man jumped out of the jeep and ran inside.

39
00:02:15.894 --> 00:02:20.356
Whiz-hoo! Roxy blasted open the mansion's doors and went in.

40
00:02:22.317 --> 00:02:24.057
But she didn't see the man anywhere.

41
00:02:26.498 --> 00:02:28.199
Using her super hearing, she listened.

42
00:02:30.656 --> 00:02:32.497
Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock.

43
00:02:32.517 --> 00:02:34.778
Roxy could hear many clocks, all ticking at once.

44
00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:41.422
Roxy followed the sounds to the basement.

45
00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:48.586
There she found a laboratory full of clocks, watches, and calendars.

46
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:52.227
The man with the safari hat stood before a giant clock.

47
00:02:53.188 --> 00:02:56.610
Instead of hours and minutes, years and centuries marked the clock.

48
00:02:59.451 --> 00:03:00.452
"How did you get in here?"

49
00:03:00.784 --> 00:03:01.365
asked the man.

50
00:03:02.346 --> 00:03:03.266
Roxy didn't answer.

51
00:03:03.287 --> 00:03:04.508
"Who are you?"

52
00:03:04.728 --> 00:03:05.248
she asked.

53
00:03:06.209 --> 00:03:07.470
The man folded his arms.

54
00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.633
"I'm Professor Flashback," he said.

55
00:03:10.653 --> 00:03:12.875
"And I'm time traveling."

56
00:03:12.895 --> 00:03:15.037
"Time traveling?"

57
00:03:15.417 --> 00:03:16.058
asked Roxy.

58
00:03:16.078 --> 00:03:19.181
"Yes," said Professor Flashback.

59
00:03:19.201 --> 00:03:22.444
"I wanted to study real live dinosaurs.

60
00:03:23.485 --> 00:03:26.768
So I made Metro City travel millions of years into the past."

61
00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:31.322
"Well, you have to return the city to the present," said Roxy.

62
00:03:31.342 --> 00:03:34.684
"Dinosaurs are destroying everything!"

63
00:03:34.704 --> 00:03:38.206
"Hmm," said Professor Flashback.

64
00:03:38.226 --> 00:03:41.588
"The present is so boring.

65
00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.610
Let's go to the Stone Age instead!"

66
00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.471
He reached for the clock's hand.

67
00:03:47.491 --> 00:03:50.113
"No!" said Roxy.

68
00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:53.695
"You can't just—" Smash!

69
00:03:54.175 --> 00:03:55.816
The laboratory door burst open.

70
00:03:56.742 --> 00:03:58.435
Dinosaurs swarmed inside!
